    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You feel drowsy... Take one last look at your device, and then:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixels everywhere!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a dungeon, forced to battle in deadly arenas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself and fight your way through intense battles, ruthless enemies, and ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win thrilling matches, gather resources, craft powerful gear, buy and equip the best weapons, and master your combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All to prepare for the ultimate showdown against the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully animated pixel art</strong> with smooth 8-directional movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time action RPG</strong> gameplay that keeps you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of <strong>challenging enemies</strong> to test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple arenas</strong> to battle in, each with unique layouts and designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse game modes</strong> to suit different playstyles and keep things fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and utilize a wealth of <strong>objects and items</strong> to gain the edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of <strong>powerful weapons</strong> and unleash <strong>devastating abilities.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and strategize with <strong>passive abilities</strong> and game-changing <strong>superpowers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutscenes in the form of pixel art comics</strong> that bring the story to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You feel drowsy... Take one last look at your device, and then:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixels everywhere!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a dungeon, forced to battle in deadly arenas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself and fight your way through intense battles, ruthless enemies, and ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win thrilling matches, gather resources, craft powerful gear, buy and equip the best weapons, and master your combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All to prepare for the ultimate showdown against the final boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautifully animated pixel art</strong> with smooth 8-directional movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time action RPG</strong> gameplay that keeps you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of <strong>challenging enemies</strong> to test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple arenas</strong> to battle in, each with unique layouts and designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse game modes</strong> to suit different playstyles and keep things fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and utilize a wealth of <strong>objects and items</strong> to gain the edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of <strong>powerful weapons</strong> and unleash <strong>devastating abilities.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and strategize with <strong>passive abilities</strong> and game-changing <strong>superpowers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutscenes in the form of pixel art comics</strong> that bring the story to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
